# Root build context is for the web image only. Send only its sources and
# verified editor runtimes, not host data, credentials or development archives.
**
!apps/
!apps/web/
!apps/web/**
!packages/
!packages/craft-editors/
!packages/craft-editors/site/
!packages/craft-editors/site/**
!packages/craft-editors/*-classic-comments.patch
!deploy/
!deploy/web/
!deploy/web/**
**/node_modules
**/.cache
**/target
**/dist
**/data
**/logs
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
**/.git
apps/web/.generated-public
apps/web/.test-build
apps/web/public/craft-editors
